<title>USA: First Montauk plans shareholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>First Montauk plans shareholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>RED BANK, N.J. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Montauk Financial Corp said on Thursday it planned to effect a shareholder rights offering.</p>
<p>After a registration statement was filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, First Montauk said it intended to issue one subscription right for each share of common stock held by a record date to be determined.</p>
<p>The offering was subject to shareholder approval of an increase in the company's authorized shares, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
